  "details": "Warp effects tend to be very flashy. and sometimes, people dont enjoy leaving with a big whirl of confetti, or a distracting, flashy flower. my suggestion to this would be to add vrchat plus exclusive (or everyone-available) simple entrance animations, such as a 'pop' like a bubble, or a woosh of wind, would be simple enough, accessable to everyone, and would add more flavor to people that may lack the funds to buy shop items, but still want to be a 'cool person' with a nice image.",
